{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "代码就是金库",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 148.04,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一个准确的定义。",
   "spoken": "先给一个准确的定义。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.328,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.079
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "智能合约，是部署在区块链上、按代码自动执行的程序。它可以持有资产，也可以转出资产。",
   "spoken": "智能合约，是部署在区块链上、按代码自动执行的程序。它可以持有资产，也可以转出资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.148,
   "dur": 8.28,
   "speechStart": 4.246,
   "speechEnd": 11.588
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "压成一句话就是：一段公开的、不可撤回的、直接控制资金的代码。",
   "spoken": "压成一句话就是：一段公开的、不可撤回的、直接控制资金的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.648,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 12.746,
   "speechEnd": 17.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "任何人，都可以用任意参数、任意顺序调用它。",
   "spoken": "任何人，都可以用任意参数、任意顺序掉用它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.036,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 19.134,
   "speechEnd": 22.848
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "打个比方。它像一台放在广场中央的自动售货机。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。它像一台放在广场中央的自动售货机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.888,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 23.986,
   "speechEnd": 28.067
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "机器里装着真金白银，这就是合约余额。",
   "spoken": "机器里装着真金白银，这就是合约余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.124,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 29.222,
   "speechEnd": 32.269
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "电路图贴在外壳上，谁都能看。合约的字节码一定公开，源码通常也公开。",
   "spoken": "电路图贴在外壳上，谁都能看。合约的字节码一定公开，源码通常也公开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.328,
   "dur": 7.344,
   "speechStart": 33.426,
   "speechEnd": 39.84
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "全世界的人，可以全天候来投币、按按钮、拍打机器。",
   "spoken": "全世界的人，可以全天候来投币、按按钮、拍打机器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 40.892,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 40.99,
   "speechEnd": 45.668
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "机器装好以后，就不能打开维修。",
   "spoken": "机器装好以后，就不能打开维修。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 46.728,
   "dur": 3.384,
   "speechStart": 46.826,
   "speechEnd": 49.266
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "如果留了维修门，也就是升级代理，这把钥匙本身就成了攻击目标。",
   "spoken": "如果留了维修门，也就是升级代理，这把钥匙本身就成了攻击目标。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 50.332,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 50.43,
   "speechEnd": 55.644
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "机器吐错了钱，没有客服能帮你追回。交易是不可逆的。",
   "spoken": "机器吐错了钱，没有客服能帮你追回。交易是不可逆的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 56.696,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 56.794,
   "speechEnd": 61.327
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "但这个比方有个地方不成立。真实的售货机，一次只服务一个人。",
   "spoken": "但这个比方有个地方不成立。真实的售货机，一次只服务一个人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 62.364,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 62.462,
   "speechEnd": 67.543
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "合约在一笔交易里，可以被同一个人反复调用、嵌套调用。",
   "spoken": "合约在一笔交易里，可以被同一个人反复掉用、嵌套掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 68.584,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 68.682,
   "speechEnd": 72.693
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "它还能和几十台别的售货机，拼在一起用。这叫可组合性。很多漏洞，正是从这里来的。",
   "spoken": "它还能和几十台别的售货机，拼在一起用。这叫可组合性。很多漏洞，正是从这里来的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 73.748,
   "dur": 8.112,
   "speechStart": 73.846,
   "speechEnd": 81.034
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "拿它和 Web2 后端、中心化交易所比一比，最关键的区别有三个。",
   "spoken": "拿它和 Web2 后端、中心化交易所比一比，最关键的区别有三个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 82.08,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 82.178,
   "speechEnd": 86.701
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "第一，谁能调用。Web2 要先鉴权，交易所要先过 KYC。",
   "spoken": "第一，谁能掉用。Web2 要先鉴权，交易所要先过 KYC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 87.748,
   "dur": 6.576,
   "speechStart": 87.846,
   "speechEnd": 93.474
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "合约面前，任何地址、任何合约都能来。public 函数，就是对全世界开放的 API。",
   "spoken": "合约面前，任何地址、任何合约都能来。public 函数，就是对全世界开放的 API。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 94.544,
   "dur": 8.52,
   "speechStart": 94.642,
   "speechEnd": 102.234
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "第二，出错能不能回滚。Web2 可以改数据库，交易所可以改内部账本。",
   "spoken": "第二，出错能不能回滚。Web2 可以改数据库，交易所可以改内部账本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 103.284,
   "dur": 7.08,
   "speechStart": 103.382,
   "speechEnd": 109.522
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "合约的交易不可逆，只能靠升级，或者社会共识。没有升级权限，就修不了。",
   "spoken": "合约的交易不可逆，只能靠升级，或者社会共识。没有升级权限，就修不了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 110.584,
   "dur": 7.488,
   "speechStart": 110.682,
   "speechEnd": 117.251
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "第三，攻击成本。在别处，要绕过防火墙，或者攻破内部系统。",
   "spoken": "第三，攻击成本。在别处，要绕过防火墙，或者攻破内部系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 118.292,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 118.39,
   "speechEnd": 124.221
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "在合约这里，只需要一笔交易的 gas。闪电贷还能在一笔交易里，借到上亿美元的本金。",
   "spoken": "在合约这里，只需要一笔交易的 gas。闪电贷还能在一笔交易里，借到上亿美元的本金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 125.28,
   "dur": 7.704,
   "speechStart": 125.378,
   "speechEnd": 132.137
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "能升级，是修复能力，也是攻击面。升级密钥，可能被盗。",
   "spoken": "能升级，是修复能力，也是攻击面。升级密钥，可能被盗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 133.204,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 133.302,
   "speechEnd": 138.716
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "交易所也躲不开合约安全。它的冷钱包，可能就是一个多签合约，比如开头的 Safe。",
   "spoken": "交易所也躲不开合约安全。它的冷钱包，可能就是一个多签合约，比如开头的 Safe。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 139.76,
   "dur": 7.08,
   "speechStart": 139.858,
   "speechEnd": 145.998
  }
